        "description": "Broilda Construction is a Full Site Editing (FSE) WordPress theme crafted for the building, construction, and real estate industries. Perfect for construction companies, house developers, and real estate professionals,Business WordPress theme, designed for entrepreneurs, startups, and established businesses alike. Our free theme offers a robust set of features to help you create a professional, efficient, and visually appealing website without any additional cost. this theme features a modern layout with smooth animation transitions, a fully designed homepage, and a collection of customizable inner pages. Built with a responsive design and intuitive block structure, Broilda Construction provides the flexibility to create visually engaging, professional websites for any construction or property development project."
